   [OK] the ephemeris demands alpha >= 1.260 (post-EFE, 2 sigma) -- and that lands INSIDE the range the literature already flags (Sereno-Jetzer alpha >~ 1.5), so the number is not an artefact of this parameterisation

  COST TO SPARC of moving alpha 1 -> 1.260: rms 0.1016 -> 0.1030 dex (+0.0014 dex = +0.042 sigma_int)
  COST TO SPARC of moving alpha 1 -> 1.500          : rms 0.1016 -> 0.1042 dex (+0.0027 dex)
